WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.418
A Cannabis computing job begins with its dependencies. Independent tasks can

00:00:05.418 --> 00:00:10.835
run together. Tasks that need earlier outputs wait until those outputs

00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:11.820
are ready.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:18.524
The client packages the workload and encrypts its private contents. Candidate

00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:24.400
placement matches runtime, memory, accelerators, quoted cost, and delivery estimates.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:30.031
The protected execution design returns encrypted outputs bound to the original

00:00:30.031 --> 00:00:35.662
job. Your client verifies their integrity, decrypts them, and reconstructs the

00:00:35.662 --> 00:00:41.292
declared result files. Custom merging logic must be declared and run

00:00:41.292 --> 00:00:43.340
in an approved environment.
